{"unit_id":"LCQ-1024__dsh-prompt-enhancer#card-zh","repo":"LCQ-1024/dsh-prompt-enhancer","commit":"8ed8036bf1b60403210228c0e02edba5c959db11","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-enhancer 是 DSH Web 输入框的提示词增强插件，会在模型选择区域附近添加 ✨ 按钮。点击后，它把尚未发送的草稿交给 DSH 当前配置的模型，按内置指令改写成更清晰、可执行的提示词，并在弹窗中并排流程展示原文与改写结果。你可以采用新文本替换草稿，也可以拒绝并保留原文；简单问答会尽量少改，复杂需求会按目标组织内容。适合希望在发送前整理问题、实现要求或故障描述的 DSH Web 用户。插件可配置模型路由、输出上限、超时和系统提示词；默认从 DSH 设置中解析模型，不需单独配置插件 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["client-v3.js:333-391","client-v3.js:664-719","index-v5.js:122-180"]}
{"unit_id":"LCQ-1024__dsh-prompt-enhancer#card-en","repo":"LCQ-1024/dsh-prompt-enhancer","commit":"8ed8036bf1b60403210228c0e02edba5c959db11","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-prompt-enhancer adds a ✨ button to the DSH Web composer. It sends an unsent draft to the configured model and shows the rewrite beside the original. Accept it to replace the draft or reject it to keep the original. Model, output, timeout, and prompt settings are configurable.","source":"generated","evidence":["client-v3.js:333-391","client-v3.js:664-719","index-v5.js:122-180"]}
