{"unit_id":"LCQ-1024__dsh-prompt-enhancer#feature-1","repo":"LCQ-1024/dsh-prompt-enhancer","commit":"8ed8036bf1b60403210228c0e02edba5c959db11","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-enhancer 的功能「草稿提示词改写」：点击输入框旁的增强按钮后，插件将未发送文本交给 DSH 配置的模型，返回更清晰、便于执行的提示词。","source":"generated","evidence":["client-v3.js:664-719","index-v5.js:143-180"]}
