{"unit_id":"LCQ-1024__dsh-prompt-enhancer#feature-4","repo":"LCQ-1024/dsh-prompt-enhancer","commit":"8ed8036bf1b60403210228c0e02edba5c959db11","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-enhancer 的功能「自适应识别草稿输入框」：客户端扫描 DSH composer 中可见的文本框，并把增强按钮放到模型选择器或发送按钮旁，以适应界面重绘。","source":"generated","evidence":["client-v3.js:169-250","client-v3.js:333-458","client-v3.js:728-750"]}
